{"id":"n2-169","title":"～を問わず (〜wo towazu)","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Means 'regardless of' or 'irrespective of'.","longExplanation":"「～を問わず」 is used to express that something applies or is available without any distinction regarding the stated nouns/conditions. It means 'regardless of...' or 'irrespective of...'.","formation":"Noun + を問わず","examples":[{"jp":"このイベントは、年齢を問わず、誰でも参加できます。","romaji":"Kono ibento wa, nenrei o towazu, dare demo sanka dekimasu.","en":"This event is open to everyone, regardless of age.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"イベント","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"年齢","vocabId":"1600240","reading":"ねんれい"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"問わ","vocabId":"1536000","reading":"とう"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"誰","vocabId":"1416830","reading":"だれ"},{"surface":"でも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"参加","vocabId":"1302090","reading":"さんか"},{"surface":"でき","vocabId":"1340430","reading":"でき"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"このスーパーは、日曜日を問わず、毎日開いています。","romaji":"Kono suupaa wa, nichiyoubi o towazu, mainichi aite imasu.","en":"This supermarket is open every day, regardless of Sunday.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"スーパー","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"日曜日","vocabId":"1464900","reading":"にちようび"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"問わ","vocabId":"1536000","reading":"とう"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"毎日","vocabId":"1524720","reading":"まいにち"},{"surface":"開い","vocabId":"1202440","reading":"ひらく"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"彼女は、暑さ寒さを問わず、毎朝散歩をしています。","romaji":"Kanojo wa, atsusa samusa o towazu, maiasa sanpo o shite imasu.","en":"She takes a walk every morning, no matter the heat or cold.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"暑","vocabId":"1343460","reading":"あつい"},{"surface":"さ","vocabId":"1291070","reading":"さ"},{"surface":"寒","vocabId":"1955940","reading":"かん"},{"surface":"さ","vocabId":"1291070","reading":"さ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"問わ","vocabId":"1536000","reading":"とう"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"毎朝","vocabId":"1524700","reading":"まいあさ"},{"surface":"散歩","vocabId":"1303620","reading":"さんぽ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"社長は、国籍を問わず、すべての社員を平等に扱っています。","romaji":"Shachou wa, kokuseki o towazu, subete no shain o byoudou ni atsukatte imasu.","en":"The company president treats all employees equally, regardless of nationality.","words":[{"surface":"社長","vocabId":"1322920","reading":"しゃちょう"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"国籍","vocabId":"1286780","reading":"こくせき"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"問わ","vocabId":"1536000","reading":"とう"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すべて","vocabId":"1595730","reading":"すべて"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"社員","vocabId":"1322670","reading":"しゃいん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"平等","vocabId":"1507670","reading":"びょうどう"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"扱っ","vocabId":"1153440","reading":"あつかう"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]}]}